# Form Patterns

Forms use react-hook-form + zod with a custom `<Form>` wrapper from `@/uikit/form`.

## Schema File (`schema.ts`)

```tsx
import { z, zodResolver } from "@/uikit/form";

const ProfileSchema = z.object({
  name: z.string().trim().min(1, "Tên không được để trống"),
  email: z.string().email("Email không hợp lệ"),
  phone_number: z.string().refine(
    (value) => isValidPhoneNumber(value),
    "Số điện thoại không hợp lệ",
  ),
});

export type ProfileForm = z.infer<typeof ProfileSchema>;
export const ProfileResolver = zodResolver(ProfileSchema);
```

## Form Usage

```tsx
import { useForm } from "@/uikit/form";

const form = useForm<ProfileForm>({
  resolver: ProfileResolver,
  defaultValues: { name: "", email: "", phone_number: "" },
});

const onSubmit = async (data: ProfileForm) => {
  const { data: result, error } = await updateProfile(data);
  if (error) return showToast(error.message);
  router.back();
};

return (
  <Form {...form} onSubmit={onSubmit} formClassName="px-4 gap-5" formScrollable>
    <FormInput name="name" label="Họ tên" />
    <FormInput name="email" label="Email" editable={false} />
    <FormDateInput name="birthday" label="Ngày sinh" />
    <FormSelection name="gender" label="Giới tính" options={genderOptions} />
  </Form>
);
```

## Rules

- Separate `schema.ts` file per form with zod schema, inferred type, and resolver
- Import `z` and `zodResolver` from `@/uikit/form`
- Error messages in Vietnamese by default
- Form fields: `FormInput`, `FormDateInput`, `FormSelection`, `FormCalendar`
